This is Chinese language decoding recipe
1. activate the foundation_features environment
2. run server side program on one terminal (will use model in https://huggingface.co/shenglisten/model_julius4wav2vec2_cn)
3. then run another client side program on another terminal (will use model in https://huggingface.co/shenglisten/Centurion_wav2vec2_cn)
